{
  "id": "tr8-mckaudio",
  "name": "909 · 707 · 606 · 727 (TR-8 Recordings)",
  "tagline": "909-, 707-, 606- and 727-style voices recorded from a TR-8 by MckAudio, CC0",
  "description": "One-shots recorded by MckAudio from the individual voices of a Roland TR-8 with a Zoom U-24 interface (48 kHz/24-bit, normalised): kicks, attack kicks, snares, hats, cymbals, claps, rims and toms in the machine's 909, 707 and 606 models, plus the full 727 Latin percussion set. Four ready kits: 909, 707, 606 and 727 Latin percussion. The TR-8's own 808 voices are left out here — use the TR-808 recordings pack for those. These are recordings of the TR-8's digital models, not of vintage 909/707/606/727 units.",
